msgctxt "Comment"
msgid "Press, move right, release."
msgstr "Бас, оңға жүгірт, босат."

#: data/konqueror_gestures_kde321.khotkeys:2729
msgctxt "Comment"
msgid ""
"Press, move down, move half up, move right, move down, release.\\n(Drawing a "
